//! Closed structural catalogue for eleven recursive-ancestry row bindings.
//!
//! The bindings select seven cryptographically distinct receipts: two copied
//! from authenticated positive ancestry and five generated by the closed
//! negative producer phase.
//!
//! Parsing and validating this post-generation document does not authenticate
//! any receipt. A later derive-first replay must compare the measured bytes and
//! cryptographic result before it can construct any non-serializable authority.

